WEBVTT

00:12:59.436 --> 00:13:01.396
Where am I?

00:13:02.116 --> 00:13:03.836
And what do I want?

00:13:04.636 --> 00:13:09.956
The act of asking these three questions
in the heart of our daily life,

00:13:09.996 --> 00:13:11.636
as we walk,

00:13:11.636 --> 00:13:13.756
will help us to wake up.

00:13:14.996 --> 00:13:16.436
Because the fact is,

00:13:16.476 --> 00:13:21.076
if we keep going
in the direction we are going,

00:13:21.116 --> 00:13:25.956
there is no doubt
our civilization will end soon.

00:13:27.436 --> 00:13:32.476
Many civilizations have ended,
and ours is no different.